 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 648200,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"9\">\n  <li>The table shows the values of <span data-math=\"4^x\">4^x</span> and <span data-math=\"100x^2\">100x^2</span> for some values of <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>.<br>    \n<table class=\"os-raise-skinnytable unnumbered\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span></th>\n          <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"4^x\">4^x</span></th>\n          <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"100x^2\">100x^2</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td><span data-math=\"1\">1</span></td>\n          <td><span data-math=\"4\">4</span></td>\n          <td><span data-math=\"100\">100</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><span data-math=\"2\">2</span></td>\n          <td><span data-math=\"16\">16</span></td>\n          <td><span data-math=\"400\">400</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><span data-math=\"3\">3</span></td>\n          <td><span data-math=\"64\">64</span></td>\n          <td><span data-math=\"900\">900</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><span data-math=\"4\">4</span></td>\n          <td><span data-math=\"256\">256</span></td>\n          <td><span data-math=\"1,600\">1,600</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><span data-math=\"5\">5</span></td>\n          <td><span data-math=\"1,024\">1,024</span></td>\n          <td><span data-math=\"2,500\">2,500</span></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n <br>     <p>Looking at the patterns in the table, choose the best answer to explain why, as the value of <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> increases, the values of the exponential expression <span data-math=\"4^x\">4^x</span> will eventually overtake the values of the quadratic expression <span data-math=\"100x^2\">100x^2</span>.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1278257,
     "content_html": "The value of <span data-math=\"100x^2\">100x^2</span> grows by a factor of <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> every time and the value of <span data-math=\"4^x\">4^x</span> grows by different factors."
    },
    {
     "id": 1278258,
     "content_html": "The value of <span data-math=\"100x^2\">100x^2</span> grows by different factors and the value of <span data-math=\"4^x\">4^x</span> grows by a factor of <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> every time."
    },
    {
     "id": 1278259,
     "content_html": "The value of <span data-math=\"100x^2\">100x^2</span> grows by a factor of 4 every time and the value of <span data-math=\"4^x\">4^x</span> grows by different factors."
    },
    {
     "id": 1278260,
     "content_html": "The value of <span data-math=\"100x^2\">100x^2</span> grows by different factors and the value of <span data-math=\"4^x\">4^x</span> grows by a factor of 4 every time."
    }
   ],
